window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A dying goddess. A fractured prophecy. A magicless elf who shouldn’t exist. Elliah grew up in hiding, her mother’s whispered warnings of treachery and death trailing her every step. A single misstep draws the attention of those who fear what her survival heralds. Her escape rests in the hands of a dragon-hunted warrior blinded by faith. The truth of her existence is a weapon, foretold yet unfulfilled. As dragons stir and ancient powers awaken, Elliah must choose the fate she’s spent her life fleeing—or risk the ruin of all she loves. Mother of Trees is the thrilling first book in the Thaumatropic Roots epic fantasy series. Enter a world of dangerous magic, shifting prophecies, and dragons emerging from the shadows of legend. Buy Mother of Trees to expose deep-rooted secrets today!</p>"; 
